recommend keep-going the four-room index fold is the next crux and its meter now reads the law rather than a copy -- active-designing 86 stale rows, counsel 112, expanding-prompts 78, waymarks 41, 317 together under a ceiling that only falls, each its own round since folding a room's index rewrites its front door. Beside it stands a thing this lap saw and left: the REDS headline is one sentence that grows by a clause on every fold, and it now narrates sixteen of them. A fold narration is a list of what is on disk, which is the roster shape this row just booked for the fifth time, and reading it from the archive filenames would retire the sentence entirely. The session-log fold that would bring session-logs/README.md under its declared bound waits on Keaton's word and is listed as an open door.
